      "text": "Dorfman and coauthors improve the multipass delete-min upper bound to O(log n · log* n · 2^(log* n)) and explicitly retain the logarithmic target as open. The saved excerpt occurs on printed page 24:3.",
      "citation": "original"
    },
    {
      "date": "2023",
      "text": "Sinnamon and Tarjan announce the logarithmic amortized delete-min bound. Their multipass decrease-key bound is O(log log n · log log log n), while slim and smooth heaps attain O(log log n). These are different guarantees for different heap variants.",
      "citation": "resolution"
    },
    {
      "date": "2025",
      "text": "The revised paper states the multipass sequence bound as Theorem 7.18. The work appears in ACM Transactions on Algorithms 21(4), Article 37, and resolves the historical question retained here.",
