      "text": "Brandt, Grunau, and Rozhoň prove the o(√log n) → deterministic O(log* n) speedup in Theorem 1.2. Their Conjecture 1.3 proposes the stronger o(log n) threshold for LCA; the VOLUME question considered here is explicitly tracked by later sources.",
      "citation": "gap"
