      "text": "The revised quantum-advantage paper extends the clustering simulation to component-wise online locality on general graphs. Its deterministic constant-locality specialization has O(√n·polylog n) LOCAL complexity.",
      "citation": "sublinear"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-09 review: negative corollary",
      "text": "Composing dynamic-to-online simulation, the constant-locality component-wise conversion, and the sublinear LOCAL simulation rules out the requested witness. The card records the derivation explicitly; no withdrawn dynamic derandomization theorem is invoked.",
