    {
      "text": "The answer required from the decider is only yes or no. On a negative input it need not compute the exact larger complexity, and on a positive input it need not distinguish constant, iterated-logarithmic, and doubly logarithmic algorithms. This avoids hiding an undefined symbolic representation of an arbitrary asymptotic function inside the output requirement."
